      "label": "Proactive Problem-Solving",
      "quote": "Last month we were packed at lunchtime, and he changed into a uniform and came down to help us turn tables and run dishes. When the kitchen was slow sending dishes out, he went in himself to talk to the head chef, then came out and apologised to the guests table by table."
